Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: aipicam-config
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Shared stream config for the aipicam camera pipeline
 Ships /etc/aipicam/streams.conf, the single source of truth for
 picam-raw's raw camera stream dimensions and ports. picam-raw
 (producer) and picam-orchestrator, picam-hailo, picam-recorder
 (consumers) all read this file so their view of the stream's
 geometry can't silently drift apart — picam-raw's wire protocol
 carries no width/height field, so a mismatch here previously meant
 silent frame corruption with no error raised anywhere.
 .
 This package installs no binary and runs no service; it is a
 dependency of every camera-pipeline package above.
